<title>UK: BayerVB unit sets 100 million rand five-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB unit sets 100 million rand five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK OVERSEAS FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.0	MATURITY    29.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.20    PAY DATE    29.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> JOINT LEAD  BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
